  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;By reason of the outlook of the basement playroom/office being restricted solely to a fixed ground-floor rooflight, the room fails to be served by any operable windows, limiting natural ventilation and likely to result in the room being reliant on artificial or mechanical means. Furthermore, because daylight would enter exclusively from the ground floor rooflight, the outlook from the room would be skywards, creating a tunnel effect and somewhat oppressive internal environment. T&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;he proposed development would, thus, result in a poor and substandard form of accommodation, contrary to policy D6 of the London Plan and policies LP2 and LP17 of the Hackney Local Plan LP33 (2020).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; white-space-collapse: preserve; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;"
  ],
